# GNU Make entry point for the complete WeaverSSH build system.
# The historical Makefile remains authoritative; this file layers portable
# source-build, native-package, source-release, repository-release, Go 1.23.2,
# MQTT-framed gRPC, optional OPA Rego policy, runtime enforcement, policy
# revision/query/update, pluggable storage, compliance evidence, managed
# compliance operations, cryptographic evidence binding, chrono, optional
# ani03sha/chrono provider, compositional VFS, managed transfer, archive policy,
# versioned API contracts, and origin runtime compatibility targets.
